# Where the Live app gets its data (services/api, the /v1/resident surface).
#
# Unset: the app states plainly that no API is configured — there is no
# demonstration data in this app any more; every screen reads the record.
#
# Local development against the API on this machine:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
# (run the API per SETUP_LOCAL.md; with auth off it impersonates
# DEV_IMPERSONATE_RESIDENT, so what the app shows is that renter's tenancy)
#
# Production:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.dwellm8.com
# (Cloudflare-proxied. Authentication is enforced there: requests carry a GIP
# bearer for the `live` surface, so this needs the sign-in flow)
#
# Copy to .env and fill in; .env is gitignored, this file is the record.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
